{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/dec2d1ded7df4706e01db85bbedef17b.avif?t=1772777110\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/dec2d1ded7df4706e01db85bbedef17b.avif?t=1772777110 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BARON \u2013 The First Realistic Open World Mafia RPG Set in Turkey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the criminal underworld of Ankara, <strong>BARON</strong> places players at the heart of a story about justice, loyalty, and revenge. After losing his parents at a young age, <strong>Alparslan</strong> takes a stand against a corrupt mafia regime to protect his neighborhood and uncover the truth behind his father\u2019s murder. But this is only the beginning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/49bed2358101f34564fba85942778be0.avif?t=1772777110\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/49bed2358101f34564fba85942778be0.avif?t=1772777110 width=800 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf What to Expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f A highly immersive world reflecting Turkish culture and daily life<br>(local street vendors, neighborhood caf\u00e9s, Atat\u00fcrk statues, mosques)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Fully voiced Turkish characters with professional dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f A deep, choice-driven story that shapes the future of your world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Level-based character development and skill upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Open-world exploration and dynamic missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Day-night cycle and underground black market system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f TPS/FPS gameplay mechanics with cinematic cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/8472ee7c16260bc9e157ecaf0503d706.avif?t=1772777110\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/8472ee7c16260bc9e157ecaf0503d706.avif?t=1772777110 width=1170 height=562 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 From Backstreets to Crime Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the hustle of Ankara\u2019s streets, echoes of prayer calls from minarets, and authentic local details \u2014 <strong>BARON</strong> is more than just an action game; it\u2019s a cultural experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc4a Your Choice: Justice or Power?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The decisions you make won\u2019t only affect Alparslan \u2014 they\u2019ll change the entire neighborhood. Will you show mercy or exact revenge? Will you build an empire, or die trying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras/d376f8fedc9d67a11ebc78803d733123.avif?t=1772777110\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/extras_big/d376f8fedc9d67a11ebc78803d733123.avif?t=1772777110 width=800 height=384 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2679790?t=1772777110","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2679790?t=1772777110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679790/d0bea30d75eec32980802a651f6acd07628edd6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1